R4.2: All delegations that are initiated during Emergency mode must be revoked before or at the Emergency/Normal transition (the first time step of Normal mode). Delegations initiated in Normal mode, even if active during Emergency, do not require revocation at this transition. Delegations made during Normal mode, before Emergency mode, can persist across Emergency mode, unless revoked by an admin or expired during Emergency. Delegations during Normal mode must continue until their expiry or revocation, regardless of the system's mode transition.  
