  - Implication: This update clarifies the system is only required to allow, not guarantee, Emergency-mode delegations; revocation applies only if such delegations exist. The existential predicate for coverage is thus justified as a witness property, not an invariant. If confirmed, the model should be adjusted to ensure Emergency-mode delegations are possible, not mandatory in every run.

