run R1R2 for 6 but 5 State, 3 Session, 3 EmergencyTrigger, 3 Administrator, 5 User, 5 Role, 5 Delegation, 5 Request, 3 Clearance
run R1R2R3 for 6 but 5 State, 3 Session, 3 EmergencyTrigger, 3 Administrator, 5 User, 5 Role, 5 Delegation, 5 Request, 3 Clearance
run R1R2R3R4 for 6 but 5 State, 3 Session, 3 EmergencyTrigger, 3 Administrator, 5 User, 5 Role, 5 Delegation, 5 Request, 3 Clearance

// 4. Positive coverage: Delegations in both modes (now split for diagnostics)
run DelegationCoverageEmergency for 6 but 5 State, 3 Session, 3 EmergencyTrigger, 3 Administrator, 5 User, 5 Role, 5 Delegation, 5 Request, 3 Clearance
run DelegationCoverageNormal for 6 but 5 State, 3 Session, 3 EmergencyTrigger, 3 Administrator, 5 User, 5 Role, 5 Delegation, 5 Request, 3 Clearance
run DelegationCoverage for 6 but 5 State, 3 Session, 3 EmergencyTrigger, 3 Administrator, 5 User, 5 Role, 5 Delegation, 5 Request, 3 Clearance

